  "answer": "我搜了 1 次。答案是**新加坡数码发展及新闻部**（Ministry of Digital Development and Information，MDDI）。\n\n这份备忘录由 MDDI 常任秘书 Chng Kai Fong 和 Anthropic 联合创始人 Ben Mann 签署，部长杨莉明（Josephine Teo）在场见证。内容包括 AI 安全、模型评估、AI 采用研究，以及在公共和私营部门负责任地使用 AI。这件事是在新加坡国际网络周期间宣布的。签署日期各家说法不一：多数来源写 10 月 14 日，Tech Edition 写的是 10 月 13 日。\n\n来源：\n- [Anthropic 官方公告：Singapore office and government MOU](https://www.anthropic.com/news/singapore-office-opening)\n- [TNGlobal 报道](https://technode.global/2026/10/14/us-based-anthropic-opens-singapore-office-signs-mou-with-the-singapore-government/)\n- [The Online Citizen 报道](https://news.theonlinecitizen.com/2026/10/14/anthropic-opens-singapore-office-and-signs-ai-safety-mou-with-government)\n- [Tech Edition 报道](https://www.techedt.com/anthropic-opens-singapore-office-with-government-agreement-on-ai-safety-and-adoption)",
